WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.090
This is Hayne Hudjihini, Eagle of Delight,

2
00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:08.590
an Oto woman who came to Washington
in 1821 and 1822 with her husband,

3
00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:09.730
an Oto leader.

4
00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:13.790
She is one of very few women
among King's delegation portraits.

5
00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.690
Notice the choices King repeats:
the plain background,

6
00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:20.880
the attention to dress
and jewelry, the stillness.

7
00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:24.350
Behind this calm portrait is a sad story.

8
00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:28.850
She caught measles during the trip,
and died soon after she returned home.
